{"overview":"نادشیکو، دانش‌آموز دبیرستانی که از شیزوئوکا به یاماناشی نقل مکان کرده، تصمیم می‌گیرد کوه فوجی مشهور را که بر روی اسکناس ۱۰۰۰ ینی دیده می‌شود، ببیند. اگرچه او با دوچرخه تا موتوسو می‌رسد، به‌دلیل بدتر شدن هوا مجبور به بازگشت می‌شود. در میانهٔ مسیر، وقتی نتوانست هدفش را ببیند، غش می‌کند. وقتی بیدار می‌شود، شب است، در مکانی که هرگز ندیده و راه بازگشت به خانه‌ای ندارد. نادشیکو توسط رین، دختری که تنها در کمپینگ است، نجات می‌یابد. داستان این دختر طبیعت‌دوست با این اولین ملاقات نادشیکو و رین آغاز می‌شود.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Nadeshiko, a high school student who had moved from Shizuoka to Yamanashi, decides to see the famous, 1000 yen-bill-featured Mount Fuji. Even though she manages to bike all the way to Motosu, she's forced to turn back because of worsening weather. Unable to set her eyes on her goal, she faints partway to her destination. When she wakes up, it's night, in a place she's never been before, with no way of knowing how to get home. Nadeshiko is saved when she encounters Rin, a girl who is out camping by herself. This outdoorsy girls story begins with this first encounter between Nadeshiko and Rin.","tagline_en":"High School Girls Go Yurucamp in Nature!","runtime":24,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":8,"y":2018,"poster":"/6tvzv3SaLvXAchvEZO8LMSEbQi.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2018,"poster":"/ogq8odtClCweyQOvoI2m3Y9BjWQ.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":13,"y":2021,"poster":"/s6Mrs0IKEwZJxOEMrSvT1kZzUi.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":12,"y":2024,"poster":"/jRZgkki3duWxgHpsKHTYlwuzfX6.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":0,"y":null,"poster":"/90byo9SgPzi4j63ElPjLEaHLk4O.jpg"}],"episodes":37,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"花守ゆみり","role":"Nadeshiko Kagamihara (voice)","photo":"/zXVwGxsxwEvL1f6wxzTYtxytjDn.jpg","en":"Yumiri Hanamori"},{"name":"نائو تیاما","role":"Rin Shima (voice)","photo":"/6WJDd1z946yFfZBgpC7dWi0FyQw.jpg","en":"Nao Toyama"},{"name":"原紗友里","role":"Chiaki 'Aki' Ogaki (voice)","photo":"/j3URChYxo7xu5D8VWXlPmVZXafc.jpg","en":"Sayuri Hara"},{"name":"豊崎愛生","role":"Aoi Inuyama (voice)","photo":"/crZpbb0ILJnH7mIYZV2l4uqQx1J.jpg","en":"Aki Toyosaki"},{"name":"高橋李依","role":"Ena Saito (voice)","photo":"/aeB7z0cBTASdjKOjQriBAO6hYq4.jpg","en":"Rie Takahashi"}],"trailer":"ZlL01zXTq4c","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76075/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/qHLLmKo7udRgiSnIASVTwP2IxfJ.png"},{"n":"Amazon Video","kind":"buy","logo":"/jn6TLbtaTZntTRX9UYucHJvpQx1.png"},{"n":"Apple TV Store","kind":"buy","logo":"/qdEGArH3lKfFnAtYXMkSYk5wxuG.png"}]},"GB":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76075/watch?locale=GB","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/qHLLmKo7udRgiSnIASVTwP2IxfJ.png"},{"n":"Apple TV Store","kind":"buy","logo":"/qdEGArH3lKfFnAtYXMkSYk5wxuG.png"}]},"CA":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76075/watch?locale=CA","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/qHLLmKo7udRgiSnIASVTwP2IxfJ.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Apple TV Store","kind":"buy","logo":"/qdEGArH3lKfFnAtYXMkSYk5wxuG.png"}]},"DE":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76075/watch?locale=DE","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/qHLLmKo7udRgiSnIASVTwP2IxfJ.png"},{"n":"Joyn","kind":"ads","logo":"/fXtgvU410LTT6NjQ4ERdUzoUHQC.png"}]},"TR":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76075/watch?locale=TR","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"}]},"AZ":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76075/watch?locale=AZ","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGy